          <p>Your Name Electric was founded in {{ site.founded }} by a master electrician who was tired of seeing homeowners get burned by unlicensed work that failed inspection — or worse, created a fire hazard. The mission from day one: pull permits, pass inspections, and stand behind the work.</p>
          <p>Today we're a team of licensed journeymen and master electricians handling everything from a single GFCI outlet to full-home rewires and commercial tenant build-outs across {{ site.areaServed }}.</p>
