          <p>Every job starts with a written estimate. No work begins until you've approved the scope and price. We pull the city permit, schedule the inspection, and give you the signed paperwork when the job is done. That documentation protects your homeowner's insurance and your resale value.</p>
          <p>Our emergency line is answered by a licensed electrician 24/7 — not a call center, not an answering machine. If you have a burning smell, a sparking panel, or a total outage, call us at <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.</p>
